+ tanh((t - GS.t0)/GS.tau)))/(4*pi*GS.L*GS.sigmax^2*GS.sigmay^4*(1 + \
(MathConstants.e^(-0.5*((-2*pi*x)/GS.L + GS.x0)^2/GS.sigmax^2 - \
((-2*pi*y)/GS.L + GS.y0)^2/(2*GS.sigmay^2))*GS.Amp*(1 + tanh((t - \
GS.t0)/GS.tau)))/(4*pi^2*GS.sigmax^2*GS.sigmay^2))^1.5)\"\>"], "Output",
